OL,3,GNEWSABooker Prize judges reveal
OL,4,Ashortlisted novels after selection
OL,5,A'tussle'
OL,6,
OL,7,FPast Booker Prize winners Marlon James
OL,8,Fand Douglas Stuart have been
OL,9,Fshortlisted for the prestigious
OL,10,Fliterary award again, after a selection
OL,11,Fprocess that the judges described as "a
OL,12,Ftussle".
OL,14,FJamaican writer James is nominated this
OL,15,Fyear for his latest novel The
OL,16,FDisappearers; while Scottish author
OL,17,FStuart is shortlisted for John of John.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
