OL,3,GNEWSABooker Prize judges reveal
OL,4,Ashortlisted novels after selection
OL,5,A'tussle'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThis year's other contenders are
OL,8,Faward-winning US novelist Elizabeth
OL,9,FStrout, and British authors M John
OL,10,FHarrison, Luke Kennard and Rebecca
OL,11,FPerry.
OL,13,FBut seven books that appeared on the
OL,14,Flonglist in July have been jettisoned,
OL,15,Fand Dame Mary Beard, who chaired the
OL,16,Fjudging panel, said agreeing on the
OL,17,Ffinal six "has been, to put it mildly,
OL,18,Fhard work".
